00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:14.600
But people all over the world have united together to survive.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.410
People of the past, thank you.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.610
The Earth is well.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:23.820
And I'm doing good as well somehow.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:28.250
It's the year 2356.

